# Raw camera media stays local. The site ships optimised copies in img/,
# so committing the originals would push ~130MB for a 5MB site.
# Anchored with a leading slash so img/*.jpg is NOT ignored.
# NOTE: git sets core.ignorecase on macOS, so these match case-insensitively.
# Do not add a *.png rule here, it would swallow the favicons.
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.heic
/*.mov

# Earlier drafts of the page, superseded by index.html
/CB Portfols.html
/coby-baker-portfolio (1).html
/scroll-reveal-portfolio.html
/SR part 2.html
/index.backup.html

# Local tooling and OS cruft
/_*.html
.claude/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
